{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793951473","published":"2026-11-06T07:51:29Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:38.434065062Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-105081","CVE-2026-106565","CVE-2026-106566","CVE-2026-106567","CVE-2026-106571","CVE-2026-55628"],"summary":"Fix of 7 CVEs","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: security policy bypass via -concatenate\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-55628.patch: check the path policy for the\n       output and every input file and stop on a denied path in\n       ConcatenateImages() in wand/convert.c\n     - CVE-2026-55628\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: path policy bypass via dangling or looping symlinks\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-105081.patch: deny a path policy match whose\n       pattern is a symlink that realpath() cannot resolve in\n       IsRightsAuthorized() in magick/policy.c, add is_symlink_utf8() to\n       magick/utility-private.h\n     - CVE-2026-105081\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop at the end of a bzip2-compressed blob\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106565.patch: mark the blob as at EOF on a\n       short bzip2 read in EOFBlob() and ReadBlob() in magick/blob.c\n     - CVE-2026-106565\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: symlink target overwritten when MAGICK_SHRED_PASSES\n     enables shredding\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106566.patch: honour MAGICK_SHRED_PASSES\n       when deciding whether to use a symbolic link in\n       AcquireUniqueSymbolicLink() in magick/utility.c\n     - CVE-2026-106566\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop in PSD resource block parsing on 32-bit\n     systems\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106567.patch: reject negative and\n       out-of-range resource block offsets in ParseImageResourceBlocks()\n       in coders/psd.c\n     - CVE-2026-106567\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in pixel cache nexus size\n     computation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106571.patch: check the region size\n       multiplications for overflow in SetPixelCacheNexusPixels() in\n       magick/cache.c\n     - CVE-2026-